WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.440
The general steps for using an AED on infants and children are exactly the

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:08.460
same as they are for adults, but there is one very important difference to

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:13.720
remember, pad placement. For infants and children under the age of eight, we use a

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.680
front and back placement to ensure the pads do not touch each other on their

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.040
smaller chests. You will place one pad directly in the center of the chest

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:26.840
between the nipples and the second pad on the back right between the shoulder

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.840
blades. As always, the best way to be sure is to follow the clear graphics

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:36.480
printed right on the pads. Many AEDs are equipped to handle these younger

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:41.279
patients. Some devices come with a specific set of pediatric pads, while

00:00:41.279 --> 00:00:45.560
others have a child mode button or a special key you can insert to reduce the

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.840
energy of the shock. If the child is eight years old or younger or weighs

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.500
less than 55 pounds, you should always select that child mode or use the

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.939
pediatric pads if they are available. However, if you are in an emergency and

00:00:58.939 --> 00:01:04.779
only have adult pads, it is still okay to use them on a child or infant. Just be

00:01:04.779 --> 00:01:10.059
absolutely certain that the pads do not touch or overlap. One more critical safety

00:01:10.059 --> 00:01:14.620
rule to remember, while you can use adult pads on a child in a pinch, you should

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:18.580
never use pediatric pads on an adult because they do not deliver enough

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:24.260
energy to be effective. Once the pads are on, simply continue to listen to the AED.

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:29.459
It will walk you through the analysis and any necessary shocks, just like it

00:01:29.459 --> 00:01:32.980
did in our adult scenario.

